-lg border border-line px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/30 hover:text-maroon sm:inline-flex">GitHub</a></div></div></nav><main><div><section class="subtle-grid border-b border-line"><div class="container-page grid gap-10 py-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-center lg:py-24"><div><span class="badge border-maroon/20 bg-maroon/5 text-maroon">Qatar · evidence-backed</span><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl">What does the Qatari job market actually ask for?</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted">Enter any job title. ResearchFlow AI collects relevant Qatar job ads, extracts requirements, and generates a market report where every conclusion cites evidence.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-muted"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Deterministic analytics</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-maroon"></span>LLM narrative + validator</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5"><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>Free-tier deployable</span></div></div><div class="card p-5 sm:p-6"><form class="space-y-4"><label for="job-title" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Enter a job title</label><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row"><input id="job-title" class="input" placeholder="e.g. AI Engineer, Accountant, Civil Engineer" autoComplete="off" maxLength="120" value=""/><button class="btn-primary shrink-0" type="submit" disabled="">Generate report</button></div><p class="text-xs text-muted">Analyzes the seeded Qatar corpus across all job families. Live source adapters and Arabic extraction are on the roadmap.</p></form><div class="mt-5 border-t border-line pt-4"><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Popular titles</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">AI Engineer</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">Accountant</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">Civil Engineer</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">Marketing Manager</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">Data Analyst</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">HR Specialist</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">Registered Nurse</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-ink transition hover:border-maroon/40 hover:text-maroon">Project Manager</button></div></div></div></div></section><section class="container-page py-10"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4"><div class="card p-4"><p class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">69</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Job ads</p></div><div class="card p-4"><p class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">21</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Companies</p></div><div class="card p-4"><p class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">1</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Sources</p></div><div class="card p-4"><p class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">17</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-muted">Job families</p></div></div></section><section class="container-page py-12"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-maroon">What you get</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">A report you can defend in an interview</h2></div><a class="btn-secondary" href="/about">Read the methodology</a></div><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">Required vs preferred</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Every ad is split into must-have and nice-to-have skills, with a verbatim quote behind each extraction.</p></article><article class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">Demand, not vibes</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Counts and percentages are computed in SQL. The language model writes the narrative, not the numbers.</p></article><article class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">Cited conclusions</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Each claim references an evidence ID, and each evidence ID maps to real job cards and source links.</p></article><article class="card p-6"><h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">All job families</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">AI, finance, civil engineering, marketing, healthcare, HR, education, logistics, legal, and more.</p></article></div></section><section class="border-y border-line bg-white/60"><div class="container-page py-12"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-maroon">How it works</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Three bounded agents, one deterministic pipeline</h2><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-maroon">01</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-ink">Collect</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Robots-aware collection from permitted sources, URL canonicalization, and near-duplicate clustering.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-maroon">02</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-ink">Extract</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">Structured requirements with evidence quotes, canonical skill normalization, and a deterministic fallback.</p></article><article class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-white p-6"><span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-maroon">03</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold text-ink">Analyze</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted">SQL aggregation produces an evidence pack. The Intelligence Analyst writes a grounded report and a validator checks every claim.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="container-page py-16"><div class="card overflow-hidden"><div class="grid gap-8 p-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center"><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Try a title outside tech</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-muted">The corpus is intentionally cross-sector: accountant, civil engineer, nurse, teacher, HR specialist, marketing manager, project manager, and more. The point is to show the pipeline generalizes, not just to AI roles.</p></div><a class="btn-primary" href="/jobs">Browse the corpus</a></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="mt-20 border-t border-line bg-white/60"><div class="container-page flex flex-col gap-2 py-8 text-sm text